WEBVTT

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:12.030
I want to be a school idol
just for you, Yu-chan.

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.490
So...

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:16.320
Please just be mine.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.960
I'll go home now.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:42.520
Oh, Yu-chan!

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:44.350
Good morning!

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:45.640
Morning.

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:54.570
Hey, about yesterday...

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:57.280
Sorry for saying something so weird.

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:00.490
Let's go.

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:05.870
Can we go to the club room together today?

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:10.210
Uh, sure. I do have a meeting with Shinonome
and Touou in the afternoon, but...

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:12.170
I see.

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:15.130
It's all starting to take shape.

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:17.840
Let's do our best with this festival, Yu-chan.

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:19.050
Sure.

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:24.850
I don't want to leave your side.

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:33.150
<i>Let's go to the future!</i>
<i>Rainbow melodies</i>

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:38.490
"Nijigasaki High School Idol Club"
"Love Live!"

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:45.910
<i>The rain clears up and reveals blue skies</i>

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:48.920
<i>The winds of hope blow (Blowing)</i>

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:53.880
<i>We can feel something coming</i>
<i>and we take our very first step</i>

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.590
<i>The world is sparkling</i>

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:59.590
<i>And our hearts start to well up with (Feelings)</i>

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:03.970
<i>"We want to start running right now!!"</i>
<i>(Move on! Move on!)</i>

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:09.480
<i>The tiny melodies blend together (Our Colors)</i>

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:11.690
<i>Let's paint this arch, now</i>

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:15.280
<i>It resonates throughout the city</i>
<i>(Reaching for far blue sky!)</i>

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:17.440
<i>Let's sing together!</i>

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:23.240
<i>My feelings are overflowing,</i>
<i>there's no stopping them now</i>

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:25.910
<i>Rainbow-colored passions!!</i>

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:28.120
<i>Colors painted in courage</i>

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:30.790
<i>Let's create a bridge to the future</i>

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:34.250
<i>Beyond the endless sky</i>

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:36.550
<i>Resounding sympathy</i>

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.920
<i>Miracles are blooming</i>

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:42.140
<i>--Let's go! Shine towards the future, melodies</i>

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:44.600
<i>--Yes, I know I'm not alone</i>

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:47.270
<i>You're all always by my side</i>

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:53.310
<i>So let's connect our dreams together</i>

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:04.240
Shinonome Academy would like to officially
participate in the School Idol Festival.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:07.160
Touou Academy is in, too.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:11.580
That's wonderful! We look forward to
working with all of you!

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:13.330
Likewise.

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.380
How is it going with the venues?

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:17.880
I heard that there were a variety of options.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:21.590
Yes. The student council
helped out with the negotiations

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:24.890
and we were able to secure
every one we requested.

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:26.220
Things seem to be going well.

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:29.890
We thought of a possible venue, as well.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:35.360
The individual venues are small,

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:38.570
but looking at all of them
makes them look bigger.

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:41.780
The fans are submitting ideas
for other entertainment,

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:44.820
so I think it'll seem even more like
an actual festival the day of.

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:47.370
Really? What kind of ideas did you get?

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:50.540
Ai Miyashita-san is going to have a <i>monjayaki</i>

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.700
stall in response to request we received.

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:54.380
A food stall?

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:57.000
I guess anything goes, huh?

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.130
It sounds like it'll be a fun festival,
just like the name suggests.

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:02.420
We can't get left behind, either.

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:03.300
Right!

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:05.640
What do the timetables
for each venue look like?

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:09.010
We'd like to fill those up when we have
a better idea for the other entertainment,

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:12.060
but Yu-san made a temporary one
for the time being.

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:14.900
Yu-san?

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.980
Huh? Oh, sorry.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:21.240
You need the documents, right?
Let's see... One sec.

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:30.120
Ladies, our great ambition
is finally about to become a reality!

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:34.920
So now let's get even more serious
with our practices!

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:36.710
Yeah!

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.710
A-Ambition?

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:44.300
What's up, Ayumu?

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:47.300
Oh, it's nothing.

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:52.140
This isn't the time to let
your guard down, Ayumu-senpai!

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:54.310
I know this is going to be a joint effort,

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:58.690
but it won't start unless
our concerts are a success!

00:04:58.690 --> 00:04:59.980
You're right.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:03.650
Is Rina here?

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:04.950
Asagi-chan.

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:08.700
Do you have a sec? We have an idea
for some entertainment,

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.870
but we wanted to get your opinion, Rina.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:13.450
Sure. Can I go for a sec?

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:14.960
But of course!

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:16.710
See you later!

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:19.590
Emma-senpai! Karin-senpai!

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:22.300
Do you have a moment?

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:23.170
Sure.

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:25.880
Shizuku! I just had a great idea!

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:26.880
President?

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:27.760
Ai-senpai!

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.300
Kanata-senpai!

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:35.060
We'll see you later!

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:44.190
Let's go train, Ayumu-senpai.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:48.740
So much that we'll steal the fans
from every other show that day.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:50.740
K-Kasumi-chan...

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:56.870
We're friends, but rivals! We're friends,
but rivals! Remember that!

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:58.250
Ayumu-chan!

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:02.000
Sorry...

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:09.050
Don't I have any fans?!

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:12.100
Kasumin is right here!

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:15.060
Kasumin.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:22.610
So for your stage, we have
a bridge leading to dreams.

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:27.610
Or a tea party with Ayumu-chan.
A trip around Odaiba with Ayumu-chan.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:30.660
We came up with a few ideas, but...

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:33.080
I think all those ideas sound great.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:35.330
No, this isn't enough!

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:37.000
R-Really?

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:40.420
This is our chance to show
the other school idol fans

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:44.340
just how amazing you are, Ayumu-chan!

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:46.630
Amazing? Me?

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:48.340
Let's come up with more ideas.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:49.680
Yeah.

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:57.100
I can't see my own strengths,

00:06:57.100 --> 00:07:00.810
but it makes me happy hearing
Kyoko-chan and the others say that.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:03.690
It's been a few months since
I joined the School Idol Club,

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:06.820
and now, the school idols
and fans are getting together,

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:09.570
making our world expand even more.

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:14.660
Yu-chan's working so hard
and having so much fun...

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:16.870
I know I actually think this, but...

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:22.790
I'm so embarrassed.

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:28.670
I have to get back to practice.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:35.680
Did something happen?

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:37.350
Huh? What do you mean?

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:41.560
Please don't try to change the subject.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.860
Yeah, it's not a big deal...

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:47.520
Come to think of it...

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:51.530
No, it's nothing.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:56.700
Ayumu-san seemed to be
acting strange then, too...

00:07:56.700 --> 00:08:00.540
Huh? Oh, it's nothing for you
to be worried about, Setsuna-chan.

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:03.750
--But--
--Really, we're fine.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.540
If you say so...

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:15.300
Setsuna-chan, head back to
the club room without me.

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:16.800
Ayumu, wait!

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:24.480
Let's talk about what happened yesterday.

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:25.980
We really don't need to.

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:27.360
Yes, we do!

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:33.530
We can't leave things this awkward.

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:38.580
There was something I
wanted to tell you yesterday.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:43.710
You see... there's something I want to do.

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:46.380
I have a dream now.

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:51.420
Setsuna-chan just found out coincidentally,

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:54.460
but I wanted you to be the first to know.

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:58.100
I'm sorry that I kept it a secret.

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.350
But I thought it through and made up my mind.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:05.060
So I want you to hear me out.

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:06.850
Will you?

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:08.020
No...

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:09.770
Huh?

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:13.400
That means we can't be together
any more then, right?!

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:18.030
I can tell! Because this is the first time
you've ever said anything like this!

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:19.490
I don't want that!

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:23.700
My school idol dreams have only just begun!

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:28.380
I won't be able to take
a step forward without you...

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:29.290
That's not--

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:30.590
It is, though!

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.970
It is...

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:45.060
But--

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:54.900
I'll tell you some other time.

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:57.320
Let's go.

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:49.290
It's finally only a week away!

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:52.130
How's everyone's practices going?

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:54.130
Mine's going very well!

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.550
Mine, too!

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:57.010
By the way,

00:10:57.010 --> 00:11:00.260
are we all really keeping what we're doing
a secret until the day of?

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:02.260
Well, it's more fun that way!

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:05.850
I'm not going to show my rivals
what's up my sleeve.

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.600
What about you, Ayumu-chan?

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.270
Sorry.

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:14.900
We haven't really decided
what to do for me yet.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.160
Yu-senpai!

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:24.660
I'd like to talk to you about something.

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:56.070
I don't know...

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:57.900
What I'm supposed to do?

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:05.120
Are you all going to your stages now?

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:08.370
Yeah. They're already
setting mine up apparently.

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:12.210
It's my stage, so I don't want to
leave all the work to everyone else.

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:17.130
I'm going to take time off from work
starting today so I can do my best, too.

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:18.050
Well, then...

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:19.590
See you all tomorrow.

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:22.880
Yup. See you tomorrow.

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.800
Ayumu-san.

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:27.220
Let's walk together for a while.

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:33.350
So much has changed.

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:35.190
It's truly amazing.

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:38.320
It hasn't even been that long
since the club has been reinstated.

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:43.900
This is all thanks to our fans.

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:46.700
Yeah... You're right.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:52.660
We're going to have to keep pressing forward
to follow through with all their expectations.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.500
But I...

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:01.960
But I can't move anymore.

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:05.880
Ayumu-san...

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:11.680
The reason I became a school idol
isn't for everyone's sake.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:15.980
There was only one person I wanted watching me.

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:19.360
You must be talking about Yu-san.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:22.360
But things are changing now,

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:27.910
and there are so many people
who seem to like me and support me.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:32.410
Those feelings make me happy,
and they're important to me.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:39.920
But now, the only one I like
isn't just Yu-chan anymore,

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:43.710
and I feel like I'm distancing myself, too.

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:44.840
But...

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:52.640
I was trying to hold back, too.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:53.970
Huh?

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:56.140
Hold back what I love...

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:59.980
But I just couldn't quit.

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:08.820
Since we started this, we need to
see it through to the end!

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:22.840
I can't stop. I can't hold back.

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.130
You're right.

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:30.590
Thanks!

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:48.200
We somehow made it in time.

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:51.030
It's all because you helped us out, Yu-senpai!

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.200
Now, all that's left is...

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:58.370
Ayumu.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:14:59.790
Yu-chan.

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:03.170
So, hey. I--

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.670
We did it! We finished your stage!

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:08.970
Look!

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:26.230
We all made this path
covered in flowers together.

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:30.240
Though all I really did was offer some advice.

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:36.870
You seemed down, Ayumu-chan,
so we made every single part with love.

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:43.750
It's perfect for your image, too.

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.750
We even used some floriography.

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:51.630
The floriography of
yellow gerbera daisies is...

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:55.300
Love. We just wanted to express how we felt.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:01.600
You did this all for someone like me...?

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:03.350
Don't say it like that.

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:05.900
You're so cute and pure...

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:08.190
You're always working so hard.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:12.450
That's what we love about you, Ayumu-chan.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:18.620
There's one that Yu-senpai made, too!

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:29.380
It's beautiful. What does this flower mean?

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:31.090
Feelings that never change.

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:39.310
That's the one thing that won't change.

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:47.900
A-Ayumu...

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:51.400
No fair!

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:58.450
I love you all.

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:06.750
It's been a while since
we got to go home together.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:07.790
Yeah.

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:10.210
Sorry for being selfish.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:12.550
You're cute when you're being selfish, too.

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:14.130
Oh, jeez!

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:20.510
Huh? You're not getting on?

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:22.430
Let's walk home today.

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:24.980
Okay.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:29.900
Say.

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:35.110
Does moving forward mean I'll have
even more things that are important to me?

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.240
Maybe.

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:38.490
But you know...

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:44.290
I'm the one who thought
you were cute right from the start.

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:51.380
Thanks.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:59.140
I have a lot of things to do
the day of the festival,

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:02.350
so I don't think I'll be able to
see your performance that much.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:09.770
We're all going to be performing
our own shows in different places.

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:13.070
You'll be spread out,
but your feelings are one.

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:19.950
You see... I want to play music.

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:26.790
Once the second term starts, I'm thinking about
taking the test for the music course.

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:28.210
I see.

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:33.630
I will sing for everyone.

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:37.970
The reason I was able to find my dream
was thanks to you, Ayumu.

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:47.600
And I was able to become
a school idol because of you, Yu-chan.

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:52.230
Yu-chan, thank you for everything.

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:56.940
Ayumu, thank you for everything.

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:18.340
Warming these small seeds

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:21.590
That were sowed into my heart

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:25.680
Before I knew it, that warmth

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:29.270
I was frantically pursuing
was what I was feeling

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:32.520
We looked up at the same sky

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:34.820
And dreamed distant dreams

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:38.940
The seasons that passed by

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:42.410
Finally brought us both here

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:45.910
A wind different from yesterday

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:51.250
Grabs a hold of my heart, but (forever)

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:56.590
Our feelings are connected

00:19:56.590 --> 00:20:00.090
This boulevard that leads to tomorrow

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:03.550
Has flowers of hope that bloom along it

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:07.060
I'll take the courage that you gave me

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:09.730
And hold it close...

00:20:09.730 --> 00:20:13.150
We make this promise with smiles

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:17.110
And I'll make it bloom so vividly

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:23.410
-- I promise, I promise
I'm going to get stronger

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:27.240
-- I want to tell you so many thank yous

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:30.450
-- I want to tell you so many thank yous
-- I'm moving forward my own way

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:33.750
This future that we envisioned

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:39.710
Let's make it a reality someday...!!

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:00.610
Let's continue to...

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:02.240
...support each other.

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:10.290
Everything is moving so much faster than
when we were just casually living out our days.

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:13.000
But every day is so fun.

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:17.210
We don't know our answer yet, but...

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:22.210
Let's walk together forever.

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:40.690
<i>As we slowly run down this path</i>

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:44.570
<i>Something is trying to come to life</i>

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:51.410
<i>I want to tell you, I want to tell you that</i>

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:54.200
<i>The sky that we look up at every day</i>

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:58.170
<i>Has a blue that changes with the seasons</i>

00:21:58.170 --> 00:22:04.800
<i>There are no rules, it's telling us</i>
<i>to depict it however we please</i>

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:07.090
<i>Let's not be in a hurry!</i>

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:11.560
<i>Let's enjoy this thrilling time even more!</i>

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:19.650
<i>Let's all pursue the things that we love</i>

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:24.030
<i>We don't know where we're headed to just yet</i>

00:22:24.030 --> 00:22:27.110
<i>Hopefully, there's an exciting</i>
<i>future awaiting us</i>

00:22:27.110 --> 00:22:31.620
<i>It'd make me happy</i>
<i>if we can both smile about that</i>

00:22:31.620 --> 00:22:34.240
<i>Thank you again today</i>

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:37.500
<i>Now, let us open up our very own maps</i>

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:40.670
<i>And casually take flight</i>

00:22:40.670 --> 00:22:45.960
<i>I want to dream, aspire, and dream once again</i>

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:50.180
<i>I just want to keep dreaming!</i>

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:22.380
I tried to compose a song,

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:25.750
but this is about as far as I got for now.

00:23:25.750 --> 00:23:28.010
I think it's wonderful, though.

00:23:29.050 --> 00:23:30.130
You think so?

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:33.100
Yeah, I think it's lovely.

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:39.600
Next time, "School Idol Festival
(The Place Where Everyone's Dreams Come True)."
